34. IMPORTANT SAFETY / PRIVACY

Jangan membuat fitur:

- Stealth mode
- Hidden app
- Self-delete setelah permission
- Bypass Android permissions
- Bypass PIN/password
- Hidden microphone
- Hidden camera
- Hidden screen recording
- SMS interception tanpa permission
- Gallery access tanpa permission
- Credential theft
- Accessibility abuse

Semua fitur sensitif harus menggunakan API Android resmi dan permission yang sesuai.

